      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#A9BDD6;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">Service Area</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">Radon Testing and Mitigation in Moose Jaw</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">A lot of Moose Jaw's older homes sit on full basements, and the only way to know what's in yours is a long-term test. Radon professionals who serve the city usually come from Regina, 45 minutes east.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
